  ✓ Rebuild semantics and every target proof from clean scratch
  ✓ Audit claim adequacy and real-program pinning
  ✓ Inventory and review every K rule and declaration
  ✓ Run a fresh meaningful non-vacuity mutation
  → Account for proven versus assumed boundaries and write REVIEW.md
